  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "死之沼澤遇襲,忍者謝多護送精靈死戰"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "咦!一陣子沒來這裡,沼澤的面積好像又變大了..這裡本來應該還是森林的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "沼澤會吞食森林?這種事我可沒聽過。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 11,
              "speaker_name": "索菲亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-11",
          "text": "這個死之沼澤是全大陸邪氣最重的地方,什麼事情都有可能發生,大家要特別小心...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "安靜!我聽到前面有打鬥聲!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 25,
              "speaker_name": "謝多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-25",
          "text": "可惡,看來傳聞果然是真的...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "text": "我還是不能相信,這世界上居然真有看不見的怪物!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "text": "你才剛被咬了一口而已,接受事實吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "精"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "text": "嘿,認命吧!誰教你們誤入這片沼澤!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "靈"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "text": "首領有命,凡是進入這片沼澤的都得死!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "text": "謝多,我們現在該怎麼辦?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 25,
              "speaker_name": "謝多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-25",
          "text": "....跟他們拼了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "精"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "text": "那你們就受死吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "從他們的話聽來,好像是遇到了看不見的隱形怪物呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "有這種事?這在我們度過此地時可是一大威脅,嗯...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "不如我們現在就出去和他們攜手作戰,強行越過這沼澤,同時也摸清楚這隱形怪物的底細。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "我贊成!坐視無辜旅人被敵方攻擊,這可不是我們的一貫作風!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "既然如此,我們就上陣吧!不過對手中有看不見的傢伙,大家要謹慎些!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "莉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "text": "....我不甘心..我不該輸給這些傢伙的...."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/0"
    },
    {
