        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "貝"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "text": "啊...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "糟糕,精靈們被全滅了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "這雖是一場苦戰,但感謝神庇佑我們獲得最後的勝利。對了,你們是怎麼碰上這件怪事的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 25,
              "speaker_name": "謝多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-25",
          "text": "我們在行經此地時,忽然就遭到這些傢伙和隱形的沼澤怪物攻擊,幸好各位趕來援助,不然我們大概已經不明不白的死在這裡了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "為何那些傢伙要封鎖死之沼澤?想要阻止我們前往北方嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "text": "可能和來路不明的黑暗軍進攻「聖靈之塔」一事有關...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "什麼?真有此事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "text": "是的,我們這一支精靈族住在亞述森林,世代負責守護聖地。最近集結的黑暗軍似想進攻聖靈之塔,長老深恐我們的兵力抵敵不住,所以派遣我們向哈斯米爾求救,沒想到敵方已在此布下陷阱...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "聖靈之塔究竟有什麼秘密,值得那些傢伙拼命進攻?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "text": "我們也不知道,因為那裡已有數百年沒人進去過了....不過長老深信黑暗軍一旦攻佔聖靈之塔,後果一定不堪設想,所以嚴令我們務必死守。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "原來如此。哈斯米爾也遭到敵方攻擊而死傷慘重,救兵可以不必去求了,我們這就去亞述森林增援。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/18",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1/lines/18",
          "text": "謝謝你們!這樣我們就可以放心的回去覆命了!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/1"
