    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "忍者謝多請纓加入隊伍"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "嗯,看來你似乎是個忍者,這個職業現在已經不多見了....你往後有何打算?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 25,
              "speaker_name": "謝多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-25",
          "text": "我在這森林中隱居多年,這些年來的和平生活,讓我以為這一身技藝已經沒有用了,現在我發現這種想法好像是錯了..如果你們不介意的話,我願意加入你們,與黑暗軍周旋到底!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "要與黑暗軍對陣,人手再多也不會嫌夠的。歡迎加入!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "遺憾的是,現在沒時間歡迎新人了,事態緊急,我們得立刻趕往亞述森林。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "沒問題!我們這就上路囉!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "拯救下等魔族達克塞,索爾展現包容胸懷"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
