          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "text": "嘎呼吱!希哩呼喀嚕...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "這不是下等魔族嗎?怎麼會在此出現?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "看起來好像沒有敵意的樣子,只可惜我不懂魔族的語言...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "你說什麼?我聽不清楚,稍等一下。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "達克賽"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "text": "嘎呼吱!希哩呼喀嚕...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "嗯,嗯...我明白了,我會向他們替你求情的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮,妳懂得它們的話?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "是的,我聽得懂牠在說些什麼,不過我不知道為何我聽得懂...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "沒關係,悠妮小姐,牠和你說了些什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "他說他叫達克塞,是下等的魔族戰士,因為對首領的命令產生了懷疑,而被處以監禁的刑罰,原先是由「死亡骷髏」所看管,後來我們打倒了負責防守死之沼澤的敵軍,他才乘亂逃了出來。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "惡魔族也牽涉其中嗎?這比我想像的還麻煩...那麼,這位達克塞先生對我們有何指教呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "他說魔族已遭人以某種方式操縱,他希望能加入我們一行,拯救惡魔族免於毀滅的命運。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "惡魔族能夠信任嗎?何況又是下等的惡魔...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/81dd5ef66a56/scenes/3/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "沒關係!只要有心對抗黑暗軍者,都可以加入我們一行!我們要先能相信別人,才能得到別人的信任。不是嗎?"
        }
      ],
